<h2 id=3D"intuition---min-heap">Intuition - Min-Heap</h2>
<p>A straightforward solution to this problem is to sort the array in rever=
se order and return the number at the (<code>k - 1</code>)th index:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a visual explanation of finding the k&lt;su=
